      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This report deals with three patients admitted with acute abdomen and hypovolemic shock, but at the operation, solid tumors traumatically broken were found. this finding is infrequent and is a serious problem for the surgeon who must solve the emergency and carry out the adequate surgical treatment with oncologic criterion."},
